      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "KITTYKAT CUTIE (5) gave her opponents no chance last start when she cruised to a 10 metres victory over 1800m at this track. Meets a comparable field and she can go right on with the job. LINXX (1) finished seventh last start over 2230m at this track, beaten 13 metres, after a good second at this track the run prior. Sure to enjoy an economical run from this draw. Forgive that last effort. Good enough to win a race of this calibre. ROLLING REMONA (9) is close to a win after two successive seconds, the latest over 2070m at Gawler. Capable of taking this out. STYLISTIK (6) is in the mix if he can recapture the form from two starts back that saw him finish second over 1800m at this track.",
